"PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids, October to November and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 38 years. In 2025 the middle of the grids had May to June at 185% of normal, then July to August at 54% and November to December at 48%. So far in 2026, February to March sits at 46% of normal on the middle of the grids.</p>"}
